<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99913" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκ-δίδωμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>join in giving out</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀποχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					95.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>; <i>yield up together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			; <i>give out also</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.699b
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				3.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>help</i> a poor man <i>in portioning out</i> his daughter
			(cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδίδωμι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τισὶ θυγατέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					19.59
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.268
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEnteux.</u>
				91.2
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>, but dub. sens.), <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be lent as well</i>, of money, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1606.323
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>end in like manner,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				812.51
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				800.21
			</span></i>.</div>
